Comment: Qt's build tools (moc, rcc, qmlcachegen and others, shipped only in
 the build-only motanka-qt6-dev) are under GPL-3 with the Qt GPL Exception
 1.0. The submodules also contain third-party code under their own
 permissive licences (BSD-3-clause, Expat and others), listed in each
 component's qt_attribution.json files. qtimageformats/src/3rdparty holds
 copies of libwebp (BSD-3-clause), libtiff (libtiff licence), libmng and
 jasper; only the libwebp copy can be built, on noble, when 24.04's
 libwebp is not accepted.

